    "Stage 2 regenerates the tilt yoke, GH44 receiver, dual carrier and display frame from code. Still NOT designed: how the ToF and radar boards fasten to the carrier (their hole coordinates are not measured), and the cable harness. The sensor envelopes and the other carrier variants are v0.3 references only.",
